# Route: guide 40 of 53 of the simulator's completionist route for NightElf
# (1445 of 1459 eligible quests, 164.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 56 to
# 57, 65 quests, 3.4 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Duskwood, Elwynn Forest, Ironforge, Western Plaguelands, Feralas,
# Winterspring): Darkshire -> Raven Hill -> Darkshire -> Tranquil Gardens
# Cemetery -> Darkshire -> Brightwood Grove -> The Yorgen Farmstead -> Vul'Gol
# Ogre Mound -> Darkshire -> Tranquil Gardens Cemetery -> Darkshire -> Raven
# Hill Cemetery -> Addle's Stead -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Mor'Ladim (228; Mor'Ladim 35);
# Rise, Obsidion! (3566; Lathoric the Black 52, Obsidion 52).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Crime and Punishment (377), Crime and Punishment (377),
# Knowledge in the Deeps (971), Knowledge in the Deeps (971), Mythology of the
# Titans (1050), Mythology of the Titans (1050), The Lost Tablets of Will
# (1139), Back to Uldaman (2200), Restoring the Necklace (2204), The Lost
# Dwarves (2398), Essential Artificials (2924), Essential Artificials (2924),
# The Grand Betrayal (2929), The Grand Betrayal (2929), Data Rescue (2930),
# Data Rescue (2930), Kharan Mighthammer (4341), The Fate of the Kingdom
# (4362), The Restless Dead (96394), The Restless Dead (96394), An Ancient
# Grudge (96395), Important Heirlooms (96403), Important Heirlooms (96403),
# The Treaty of Understanding (98423), Barov Family Fortune (5343), Doctor
# Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher (5382), Kirtonos the Herald (5384), The Lich,
# Ras Frostwhisper (5466), Krastinov's Bag of Horrors (5515), Of Love and
# Family (5848), The Crone of the Kraul (1101), Pusillin and the Elder
# Azj'Tordin (7441), Elven Legends (7482), Lethtendris's Web (7488), Drakefire
# Amulet (6502).

